---
layout: base.liquid
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Joe Pfohl</h1>
  <div class="hero-tagline">Senior Full-Stack Engineer | TypeScript, Next.js, Node.js &amp; AWS</div>
  <p class="hero-pitch">Hands-on builder taking complex data systems and platforms from concept to production.</p>
  <div class="hero-bio">
    <p>
      I'm a full-stack engineer and builder who takes complex systems from concept to production. I specialize in the TypeScript ecosystem (Next.js, NestJS, React, Node.js) and cloud platforms (primarily AWS).
    </p>
    <p>
      I love building software that makes complex workflows feel simple&mdash;whether that's designing visual graph-based query tools for non-technical users, wiring up event-driven ingestion pipelines, or provisioning cloud infrastructure with Terraform.
    </p>
    <p>
      I value engineering craftsmanship, practical problem-solving, and collaborating with strong engineering teams that care about building maintainable, high-impact products.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <h2>Recent Posts</h2>
  {% assign recent = collections.posts | reverse %}
  {% if recent.size > 0 %}
    {% for post in recent limit: 5 %}
      <article class="post-preview">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ post.date | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</time>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">Nothing here yet — check back soon.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
